A firearm manufacturer operating out of [[Geography/Calaria/index|Calaria]]. They specialize in particularly high-caliber, enchanted weapons. Their motto is "Just a tap'll do ya!"

Its berth aboard the [[Org/The Harlequins/Providence|Providence]] holds the Heart [[Org/Radiant Arms/Final Caliber|Final Caliber]].

Aboard the [[Phenomena/Pilgrimage|pilgrimage]] Radiant Arms joined the Party's alliance, keeping its own Heart and berth as a forward base toward whatever lies ahead of the crossing.
